er auto routines for Nanami, Hakari, Gojo, Megumi, Higuruma, Haruta, Ryu, Yuki and Todo. Plus hitbox expander, orbit target, invisibility and noclip.\n\nKill All — Noclip, Bypass (drives the game's own Reset remote in a loop until the teleport actually sticks), TP All, View Random, a one-shot BYPASS TEST pass, and a status row with a red/green dot so the state is read, never guessed.\n\nAIM\n\nLock On — prediction with smoothing compensation, target modes, and camera lock with side / height / distance offsets.\n\nVISUAL\n\nESP — corner boxes, full boxes, outlines, head dots, skeletons, tracers, and per-side labels for name, character, distance, kills and stun, plus health bar and text. Chams including evasive and stun variants, a cooldown revealer, item ESP, and a live character preview rendered in a ViewportFrame from your own avatar.\n\nAnim Filter — browse, filter and preview animations, and drive them with custom animation flags.\n\nPLAYER\n\nMisc — infinite jump, infinite dash, auto roll, walkspeed, anti-stun, no block slow, walk into domains, fly, auto surf tech, auto head tap, extra emote slot, avatar scramble / copy / restore, instant respawn, item grabber, teleport attack and a mobile button layer.\n\nAura — effect and character aura controls with rainbow and gradient cycling.\n\nAuto Piano — MIDI player with play / pause / stop, keybinds, a file browser and direct .mid download from a link.\n\nSYSTEM\n\nConfig profiles (save / overwrite / load / refresh / delete), keybinds, script unload.","tags":["jjs","jujutsu","shenanigans"],"discord":"https://discord.gg/3gdBhbDR3","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"6ab1b1ff66c86e96a90f4256","username":"quartza","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/e93bb0db2f15c3c929e7cc6393838bf19ad08309e770e3093ce377151956dbb5.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6ab1b1ff66c86e96a90f4256-1790324912408.jpg"},"lvl":4,"status":"offline","id":"6ab1b1ff66c86e96a90f4256","topMilestone":{"key":"creator